      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, please do not turn on the device!' Senya begs, sweating profusely before the machine is even attached.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Эту рыбу после банкета взял я!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I took this fish after the banquet!' the line cook confesses, voluntarily admitting to kitchen pilfering.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "А полкило дорогой икры?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And the half-kilo of expensive caviar?' Chef Barinov presses, seizing the chance to uncover other thefts.",
      "gap": 0.4
